{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "65530",
  "name": "Grand China Hotel",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "11968783"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Located in Bangkok (Bangkok City Centre), Grand China Bangkok is within a 5-minute walk of Khlong Thom Night Market and Sampeng Market.  This hotel is 0.3 mi (0.4 km) from Wat Lak Muang and 0.3 mi (0.4 km) from Khlong Ong Ang Walking Street."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 150 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and LED televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms have complimentary toiletries and bidets. Conveniences include safes and desks, and housekeeping is provided daily."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Enjoy a range of recreational amenities, including a nightclub, an outdoor pool, and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and gift shops/newsstands."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EYaowarat Road - 0.1 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Khlong Thom Night Market - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chinatown - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sampeng Market - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wat Lak Muang - 0.4 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wat Mangkon Kamalawat - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Khlong Ong Ang Walking Street - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chao Praya River - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Gurdwara Siri Guru Singh Sabha - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wat Traimit - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wat Pho - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Grand Palace - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E River City Shopping Complex - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sanamluang - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Silpakorn University - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 30.9 km / 19.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 36.7 km / 22.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe name on the credit card used at check-in to pay for incidentals must be the primary name on the guestroom reservation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EPool access available from 7:00 AM to 6:00 PM.\u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EOne child 12 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Satisfy your appetite for lunch, dinner, or brunch at The Bloom, a restaurant which specializes in international cuisine, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Relax with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge or the poolside bar. To-go breakfasts are available daily from 6:30 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
